    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you, but it feels like a loop. like, people say things get better, but there's no actual proof of that. if you look at it objectively, everything is just random entropy. we're born, we suffer, and then we die. if the end result is always the same regardless of what we do, then the struggle itself seems pretty irrational, doesn't it?",
